            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After pondering over it for a while, I think my initial suggestion on how to organize external textobject stands. Basically, put them as dependency of 'mini.ai'/'mini.nvim' and explicitly use them inside `require('mini.ai').setup({ custom_textobjects = { ... } })`.\r\n\r\nNevertheless, thanks for your efforts to create custom textobject specification!",
